body: "SYMPTOM: missing LINEAR_API_KEY, missing --team, and Linear API errors returned { success:false } from run() -> CLI exit code 0. Scripts chaining on exit status proceed as if sync succeeded.\n\nREPRO: unset LINEAR_API_KEY; pm linear sync --team ENG >/dev/null 2>&1; echo $? -> 0 (before).\n\nFIX: missing --team and the catch block now `throw`. Verified after fix: no-key=1, no-team=1."
